            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa, kana yĩla Yeova waminie kũneena ndeto isu na Yovu, Yeova amwĩa Elivasi Mũtemani, Ũthilĩku wakwa nũkwakanĩe, o na anyanyau maku elĩ; nũndũ mũtyaaneenea ũndũ ũla wa w’o, o tondũ mũthũkũmi wakwa Yovu ũneenete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yu kwondũ wa ũu, mwĩyosee tũsalũ mũonza twa mũew’a na ndũũme mũonza, na kũmũendea Yovu mũthũkũmi wakwa, na kwĩthembea nthembo ya kũvĩvw’a; na mũthũkũmi wakwa Yovu akamũvoyea; nũndũ ngamwĩtĩkĩla, nĩ kana ndikamwĩke inyw’ĩ kwĩanana na ũtumanu wenyu; nũndũ mũtyaaneenea ũndũ ũla wa w’o, o tondũ mũthũkũmi wakwa Yovu ũneenete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
